"Tests for SHA-256 hash intrinsic."

sha256-tests: {
  α: str.sha256("hello world") //= "b94d27b9934d3e08a52e52d7da7dabfac484efe37a5380ee9088f7ace2efcde9"
  β: str.sha256("") //= "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"
  γ: str.sha256("abc") //= "ba7816bf8f01cfea414140de5dae2223b00361a396177a9cb410ff61f20015ad"
  δ: str.sha256("hello world") str.len //= 64
  ε: str.sha256("é") //= "4a99557e4033c3539de2eb65472017cad5f9557f7a0625a09f1c3f6e2ba69c4c"
  ζ: str.sha256("é") str.len //= 64
}

` "str.md5 matches the RFC 1321 appendix A.5 test suite (eu-oaz72.25); the hash is over UTF-8 bytes (value from Python hashlib)"
md5-tests: {
  α: str.md5("") //= "d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e"
  β: str.md5("a") //= "0cc175b9c0f1b6a831c399e269772661"
  γ: str.md5("abc") //= "900150983cd24fb0d6963f7d28e17f72"
  δ: str.md5("message digest") //= "f96b697d7cb7938d525a2f31aaf161d0"
  ε: str.md5("abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz") //= "c3fcd3d76192e4007dfb496cca67e13b"
  ζ: str.md5("ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789") //= "d174ab98d277d9f5a5611c2c9f419d9f"
  η: str.md5("12345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890") //= "57edf4a22be3c955ac49da2e2107b67a"
  θ: str.md5("é") //= "66ddcd97cfdeabb2f6fb8a999b4bc76f"
  ι: str.md5("abc") str.len //= 32
}

RESULT: [sha256-tests values all-true?, md5-tests values all-true?] all-true? then(:PASS, :FAIL)
